  'intake.already_answered': "This question was already answered.",
  'intake.ack': "<b>Thank you.</b> Your report ({platform}, {date}) has been received. The admins review every report; outcomes appear in the channel, and no message about the decision comes here. This message deletes itself in a few seconds.",
  'intake.hotlines': "<b>Sexual content involving a minor</b>\nDo not open, download, save, forward or share it. You can also report the link yourself, once, to a hotline; you do not have to give your name. NCMEC and the ICMEC and IWF portal take reports from anyone, anywhere:\n• <a href=\"https://report.cybertip.org/\">NCMEC CyberTipline</a>\n• <a href=\"https://report.icmec.org/\">ICMEC and IWF portal</a>\n• <a href=\"https://report.iwf.org.uk/en\">Internet Watch Foundation</a>\n• <a href=\"https://www.inhope.org/what-we-do/how-to-report\">your country's hotline, through INHOPE</a>\nReport only the link, never a file.",
